Note on upstream attribution
============================

The VRAM temperature readout technique used by `gddr6-monitor/` and the
PCI device-id → MMIO-offset table in `lib/src/gddr6.c` originate from
https://github.com/olealgoritme/gddr6, which at the time of forking had
no explicit license file. The technique (mmap of /dev/mem at a
hardware-specific offset, decoded as a 12-bit field) is treated here as
a publicly disclosed reverse-engineering result, not as a creative work
under copyright. The wrapping C code, build system, monitor application,
governors, and overall toolkit structure in this repository are original
work and licensed under the MIT terms above.
